# Custom Site Enhancements

Custom Site Enhancements adds new features to your WordPress site.

## Installation

1. Upload `custom-site-enhancements` folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory.
2. Activate the Custom Site Enhancements plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress.

## Features

- Custom Post Type: New post type added with name "Custom Post Type"
- My Widget: New widget added with the option to display custom HTML or functionality.
- my_shortcode: New shortcode added, displays "My Custom Shortcode".
- Settings: Customizable settings added to admin panel.

## Frequently Asked Questions

